Fuzzing Best Practices
Start with small corpus
: Begin with 3-5 well-formed inputs
Monitor memory
: Use
Process.enumerateRanges()
to check for memory leaks
Save interesting crashes
: Check
/var/mobile/Library/Logs/CrashReporter/
frequently
Use coverage feedback
: AFL++ mode in fpicker provides better coverage
Timeout detection
: Add timeouts to detect hangs (not just crashes)
State restoration
: Reset app state between iterations when possible
Multiple mutation strategies
: Combine random, format string, and grammar-based fuzzing
Log systematically
: Keep detailed logs of crash-inducing inputs
